    title: "Interactive Initialization & Stack Detection",
    desc: "Auto-detects your ecosystem (Next.js, FastAPI, Django, etc.), generates .clckernel.yaml, and installs symbolic rule links for Cursor, Claude Code, and Antigravity.",
    output: `$ npx clckernel start
[clckernel] 🔍 Scanning workspace...
[clckernel] ⚡ Detected framework: Next.js (TypeScript) + Vitest
[clckernel] 📄 Generating .clckernel.yaml configuration...
